<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net sellers of Japan stocks in January.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of Japan stocks in January.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges from January 6 to January 31, exchange data showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	     2.45 trillion yen</p>
<p> Total foreign selling	    2.51 trillion yen</p>
<p> Net selling			 61.60 billion yen</p>
<p>Note - All figures are rounded.</p>
</text>
